title: '[FRAME] Deprecate `ProvideInherent::is_inherent_required`'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |
    Deprecates `ProvideInherent::is_inherent_required` as a first step towards its
    removal. Each inherent should always be included in every block. If the inherent
    data is optional, wrap the inner data in an `Option` instead.
    Downstream pallets that override `is_inherent_required` will see a deprecation
    warning guiding them to restructure their inherent logic.
crates:
- name: frame-support
  bump: patch
